{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2024-07", "window": 1, "start_date": 1719792000, "end_date": 1720396799, "month_true_total": 354, "quota": 6, "returned": 6, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:53:51 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "169287270", "author": {"steamid": "76561198349998889", "personaname": "CrispyKnight", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/CrispyKnight/", "num_games_owned": 137, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 69, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 69, "last_played": 1720395324, "avatar": "b98b2385ff6842b4a9f0de08b2785be13731f3a1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Sadly this game turned out to be a disappointment. While the game looks great, several of the things turned me away. \r\n\r\n1. All my abilities felt very weak and powerless. While I understand this is a rogue-lite game, I shouldn't be struggling so much just to kill common enemies due to how tanky they are.\r\n\r\n2. Much of the upgrades I found were lacking, with most of them being simple numerical changes or something like that. I also thought that the weapon affix system would have had a much larger impact, but I never really noticed it.\r\n\r\n3. The OST. No offense, but the music for this game was quite generic and repetitive. I found myself tempted multiple times to just mute the game's music and put on my own instead.\r\n\r\nIf you want a game similar to this that I think is much better, try out Gunfire Reborn, its much better in basically every way except for some subpar language translation.", "timestamp_created": 1720395739, "timestamp_updated": 1720395739, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.370441645383834839", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "169284593", "author": {"steamid": "76561198165355039", "personaname": "Lafvoo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Lafvoo/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 57, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 57, "last_played": 1720056778, "avatar": "3264eb98d983b62854a08c6484930789771a008f"}, "language": "english", "review": "its dumb", "timestamp_created": 1720392826, "timestamp_updated": 1720392826, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.416666656732559204", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169284377", "author": {"steamid": "76561198084554127", "personaname": "TheLegendofKass", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/thelegendofkass/", "num_games_owned": 113, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 2037, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1745, "last_played": 1721069878, "avatar": "fc5d8974fd3b0cd4519d382edd70e89172d6da5b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Highly addictive rogue-like, so fun with another friend (in this case my husband) we love this game so much. great graphics & controls, upgrades/load outs are awesome, music/soundtrack is catchy and a big ear-worm and its such a great unique play style. I highly recommend this game for anyone looking for a great fast paced co-op!", "timestamp_created": 1720392570, "timestamp_updated": 1720392570, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169282173", "author": {"steamid": "76561199028865217", "personaname": "mlgcreepergamez", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/thebiggestblardy/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1898, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1602, "last_played": 1731049542, "avatar": "d473fddc38f6d7914b2ca7bef51a91ce49db8afd"}, "language": "english", "review": "genuinely amazing game. I finally beat the game on a perfect run on my (was) least favorite class (commando) with the most fun run I've had since I started playing. Rubik's cube + legendary machine shotgun with rocket jump + hot potato turned my commando into a gun ship and obliterated the whole run. game makes any run/build viable due to the way its skill system works. 10/10.", "timestamp_created": 1720390381, "timestamp_updated": 1720390381, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169254080", "author": {"steamid": "76561198828787948", "personaname": "zen", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/IkeaSalesman/", "num_games_owned": 132, "num_reviews": 69, "playtime_forever": 184, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 15, "last_played": 1784527274, "avatar": "c002fa10fdfce1d6e3c84d98c5390467c3fea435"}, "language": "english", "review": "very fun", "timestamp_created": 1720369640, "timestamp_updated": 1720369640, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169253808", "author": {"steamid"